      "writtenOn": "2018-04-27T01:41:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is an issue. I changed to use another way to solve it.\n\nIt now just save the timestamp of the power lost interrupt. The deferred handler just wakes up the chipset task. The check is to compare the timestamp to ensure low pulse held for a while.",
